  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who are ideologically aligned with or sympathetic to nationalist sentiments, particularly those who view national pride as inherently positive, unifying, and aesthetically beautiful. The meme is designed to appeal to audiences who resonate with patriotic imagery and who may hold misogynistic or anti-feminist views, as it implicitly devalues feminism by contrasting it with the 'beauty' of nationalism. The visual of diverse, joyful fans draped in national flags serves as a cultural reference to rally support for nationalism while simultaneously attempting to discredit feminism, thus targeting communities that prioritize national identity over gender equality. The meme leverages the emotional appeal of unity and celebration to influence viewers who may be susceptible to ideological propaganda that frames feminism as inferior or less desirable.",
